sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    rect rgb(224, 242, 254)
    note over: Frontend / Client
    actor Admin as Admin B (Tela Desatualizada)
    participant Front as Frontend App (JS AJAX)
    end
    rect rgb(255, 249, 196)
    note over: Security & Middleware Layer
    participant Middleware as AdminSessionMiddleware
    participant Redis as Redis Cache (Session & Cache)
    end
    rect rgb(243, 244, 246)
    note over: Application & Domain Layer
    participant Action as UpdateReturnStatusAction (Slim Action)
    participant Repo as OrderReturnRepository
    participant UoW as UnitOfWork
    participant Mapper as OrderReturnMapper
    participant DB as MySQL Database
    end
    Admin ->> Front : Clica em "Recusar Devolução"
    activate Front
    Front ->> Middleware : HTTP POST /LPDHED2dC7Gjrg2b/devolucoes/102/status {version: 1, return_status_id: 5}
    activate Middleware
    Middleware ->> Redis : GET "sessao:admin:{sessionId}"
    activate Redis
    Redis -->> Middleware : Session Active Data (TTL 7200s extended)
    deactivate Redis
    Middleware ->> Action : __invoke(Request, Response, args)
    activate Action
    Action ->> Repo : find(102)
    activate Repo
    Repo ->> DB : SELECT * FROM agsc_product_return WHERE id = 102
    activate DB
    DB -->> Repo : OrderReturn entity (version = 1 in memory)
    deactivate DB
    Repo -->> Action : OrderReturn
    deactivate Repo
    Action ->> Action : setVersion(1) & setReturnStatusId(5)
    Action ->> UoW : transaction(callback)
    activate UoW
    UoW ->> DB : BEGIN TRANSACTION
    UoW ->> Mapper : save(OrderReturn)
    activate Mapper
    Mapper ->> DB : UPDATE agsc_product_return SET return_status_id=5, version=2, date_modified=NOW() WHERE id=102 AND version=1
    activate DB
    DB -->> Mapper : Rows Affected: 0 (Nenhum registro modificado)
    deactivate DB
    Mapper -->> UoW : throw new ConcurrencyException("Registro alterado por outro usuário")
    deactivate Mapper
    UoW ->> DB : ROLLBACK TRANSACTION
    UoW -->> Action : Propaga ConcurrencyException
    deactivate UoW
    note over Action, Redis: **Tratamento de Exceção & Invalidação de Cache:**\n1. Clears DAO Identity Map\n2. Invalidates stale Redis / Repository Cache\n3. Queries fresh data directly from MySQL DB
    Action ->> Action : DataAccessObject::clearIdentityMap()
    Action ->> Redis : DEL "cache:product_return:102" / CacheStrategy::delete()
    activate Redis
    Redis -->> Action : OK (Cache Invalidated)
    deactivate Redis
    Action ->> Repo : find(102) [Fresh Query]
    activate Repo
    Repo ->> DB : SELECT * FROM agsc_product_return WHERE id = 102
    activate DB
    DB -->> Repo : Fresh OrderReturn entity (version = 2, status_id = 2 "Aprovado")
    deactivate DB
    Repo -->> Action : Fresh OrderReturn
    deactivate Repo
    Action -->> Middleware : HTTP 409 Conflict {<br/>  error: "DATA_STALE",<br/>  current_data: {<br/>    version: 2,<br/>    status_name: "Aprovado",<br/>    return_status_id: 2,<br/>    date_modified: "08/08/2026 18:30"<br/>  }<br/>}
    deactivate Action
    Middleware -->> Front : HTTP 409 Conflict (Payload JSON)
    deactivate Middleware
    Front ->> Front : Intercepta HTTP 409 Conflict
    Front ->> Admin : Exibe Modal: "Dados Desatualizados. Outro usuário modificou este registro."
    Front ->> Front : Sincroniza Estado Local (Status: Aprovado, Versão oculta atualizada para 2)
    deactivate Front
